2020-02-17  HS
  A&G/MK 1-15 Moved gemUtil to 1-14, increased mbuff size, fixed TNEW
  10Hz console error by slowing prinout, see bug RTUPG-932. 

2020-11-09  TCC
  A&G/MK 1-13 Added "SFLinear Position encode ECT count" (vall) and
  "SFLinear Skew encode ECT count" (valm) to ag:Lin2DPRead for Stan.

2020-10-15  TCC
  A&G/MK 1-12 fixes problems with eoffsetting and astigmatism. Some
  code was left out of the agSeq that was unique to GN/GS. This release
  changes iocBoot/iocag-mk-ioc/stag-mk-ioc.src to load a site-specific
  agSeq top level module. See http://jira.gemini.edu:8080/browse/RTUPG-972

2020-01-07  RJC
  A&G/MK 1-11 is released as the commissioning version. Further changes
  will be documented here.

